WEBVTT

00:09:27.021 --> 00:09:32.026
the advanced critical thinking skills
they will use throughout their lives.

00:09:33.611 --> 00:09:36.155
They are learning through exploration.

00:09:36.572 --> 00:09:40.993
There is confirmation
their unique voice matters.

00:09:42.453 --> 00:09:45.497
These students have the freedom

00:09:45.539 --> 00:09:50.461
to create a world,
with their ten-year-old imaginations,

00:09:50.461 --> 00:09:53.339
that's actually grounded
in academic rigor.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.092
This is educating ...

00:09:58.218 --> 00:09:59.595
versus schooling.